// Potential Persistence Via Outlook Form | T1137.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_office_outlook_newform.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where ends_with(process.executable.caseless, "\\outlook.exe") and (file.path like "*\\AppData\\Local\\Microsoft\\FORMS\\IPM*" or file.path like "*\\Local Settings\\Application Data\\Microsoft\\Forms*")
